      "heading": "Our Corporate Development",
      "content": "The DHT business developed through three corporate milestones in 2016, 2022 and 2024. Today, DHT Furniture Vietnam develops and manages international furniture programmes as part of a family-owned furniture group with 11 production facilities across Vietnam. Our focus is to translate buyer requirements into workable product specifications, production plans, quality controls and export arrangements."
